# This repo root mixes CAD (mount/EOAT design) with software/ (the actual
# choreography code). Only the software side and repo docs are meant to be
# tracked in git - CAD files are large, don't diff meaningfully, and don't
# belong in version control here.
/*
!/software
!/.gitignore
!/README.md

# Python
**/__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
venv/
*.egg-info/

# SolidWorks lock/temp files
~$*
